5. Any prior treatments targeting the mechanism of tumor immunity, such as immune checkpoint inhibitors (e.g., anti-PD-1 antibodies, anti-PD-L1 antibodies, anti-CTLA-4 antibodies, etc.) or therapies that target immune co-stimulatory molecules (e.g., antibodies targeting ICOS, CD40, CD137, GITR, OX40, etc.);
